diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index b5fe1b2a4feac926b16f4b55fd72f2bb6eb7b711..844daf3308b68b77046744f6b4ec152cdba5b8fc 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -3,3 +3,25 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental module
+
+`src/index.ts` exports `createRentalService()`, an in-memory service that prices and books boards and
+sails by the whole day. Its rules:
+
+- Money is an integer number of euro cents; `dailyPrice` is the price of one day.
+- Times are ISO-8601 strings in UTC. A period starts and ends at midnight UTC, and `end` is the start of
+  the day after the last day rented, so `2026-07-01T00:00:00Z` to `2026-07-03T00:00:00Z` is two days.
+- The same item cannot be booked for overlapping periods. Periods that only meet at a boundary, such as
+  one ending on the day the next begins, do not overlap.
+- `quote` prices a rental without reserving the item. `book` reserves it and returns an `id`.
+- Cancellation is not implemented yet. The policy (no refund under 24 hours before the start, otherwise a
+  full refund) is still to come.
+
+```ts
+const desk = createRentalService();
+desk.addEquipment({ id: 'board-1', kind: 'board', dailyPrice: 2500 });
+desk.quote({ itemId: 'board-1', start: '2026-07-01T00:00:00Z', end: '2026-07-03T00:00:00Z' }); // total: 5000
+```
+
+Build and test with `npm test`.
